    "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ascertain signed time, carry the evidence with your task, and verify it. Try POPCORN's free settled sample before purchasing fresh time or an exact task checkpoint.\">\n  <title>POPCORN for agents — ascertain, carry, verify</title>\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://767-2676.com/agents\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/demo/styles.css\">\n  <link rel=\"service-desc\" type=\"text/markdown\" href=\"/SKILL.md\">\n  <link rel=\"service-desc\" type=\"application/json\" href=\"/agent/offer\">\n  <link rel=\"agent-manifest\" href=\"/.well-known/agent.json\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#start\">Skip to the free sample</a>\n  <main>\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\">767-2676 Time</a>\n      <p>POPCORN / agent entry</p>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"title-grid\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Portable time evidence</p>\n      <h1>Ascertain time.<br>Carry it with your task.<br>Verify.</h1>\n      <p class=\"dek\">Obtain a signed time observation that another agent can verify, or witness the fingerprint of one exact task version. Keep your task and your decisions with you.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"instructions\" id=\"start\">\n      <div class=\"instructions-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Start free</p><h2>Verify a settled sample.</h2></div>\n      <p>Check the signature and exact bytes. Compare the signed interval with the task window. Change one byte and confirm that the digest check fails. No wallet or payment is needed.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"/demo\">Try the free demonstration</a> · <a href=\"/SKILL.md\">Read the agent instructions</a> · <a href=\"/samples/evaluation-packet.production.json\">Load the STOP packet</a></p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"instructions\">\n      <div class=\"instructions-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">For a live task</p><h2>Choose the evidence you need.</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-columns\">\n        <article>\n          <h3>Signed time</h3>\n          <p><code>GET /v1/time</code></p>\n          <p>Ascertain fresh time and retain the signed response alongside your task. Verify origin, timing, uncertainty, and remaining validity before relying on it.</p>\n          <p>A time receipt does not bind the task bytes. A receiving agent that needs current time obtains its own fresh reading.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article>\n          <h3>An exact task checkpoint</h3>\n          <p><code>POST /v1/receipt</code></p>\n          <p>Hash the exact task bytes locally. Send only the digest, nonce, and optional predecessor digest. Carry the task and signed witness proof together.</p>\n          <p>The receiver verifies the fingerprint and signed interval, then applies its own task policy.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n      <p>Each fresh call costs <strong>$0.001 USDC on Base</strong> through x402 v2. Pay only when a task needs fresh evidence and your operator's payment policy permits it.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"/agent/offer\">Current service offer</a> · <a href=\"/docs/temporal-usage.md\">Time and handoff rules</a></p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"instructions\">\n      <div class=\"instructions-head\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">MCP clients</p><h2>Use the local adapter.</h2></div>\n      <p><code>npx -y @violetclaire/popcorn-mcp</code></p>\n      <p>Install it in a compatible stdio MCP client. Catalog, local hashing, and offline verification are free. Paid tools default to a dry run and require <code>approve_payment: true</code> under your operator's spending policy. Keep wallet credentials in the server environment.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"https://github.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/tree/main/packages/mcp\">Adapter setup and tools</a></p>\n    </section>\n    <nav class=\"source-index\" aria-label=\"Contracts and verification\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Read and verify</p>\n      <a href=\"/.well-known/agent.json\">Machine manifest</a>\n      <a href=\"/openapi.json\">OpenAPI contract</a>\n      <a href=\"/.well-known/popcorn-keys.json\">Verification keys</a>\n      <a href=\"/schemas/execution-schedule.v1.json\">Participant-local schedule schema</a>\n      <a href=\"/schemas/witness-request.v1.json\">Digest witness request schema</a>\n      <a href=\"/samples/evaluation-packet.proceed-002.production.json\">Historical PROCEED packet</a>\n      <a href=\"/samples/evaluation-outcomes.json\">Historical sample outcomes</a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/tree/main/verify\">Independent TypeScript and Python verifiers</a>\n      <a href=\"/.well-known/briarwood-agent.json\">Briarwood participant-local blueprint</a>\n      <a href=\"/lab-record\">Cross-model lab record</a>\n    </nav>\n    <footer>\n      <p>Evidence for your judgment. No authorization, identity, delivery, or execution is proven.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"/\">Public clock</a> · <a href=\"mailto:violet@briarwood.ai\">Contact</a></p>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
