  "/demo": {
    "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Verify a settled POPCORN checkpoint, compare its witness window, and break its digest by changing one byte. No wallet required.\">\n  <title>228 bytes / 767-2676 Time</title>\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://767-2676.com/demo\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/demo/styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#packet\">Skip to the packet</a>\n  <main>\n    <header class=\"masthead\">\n      <a class=\"wordmark\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"767-2676 Time home\">767-2676 Time</a>\n      <p>767-2676.com / San Francisco / Pacific</p>\n      <p class=\"folio\">Evaluation / 001</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"title-grid\" aria-labelledby=\"page-title\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">A settled public sample</p>\n      <h1 id=\"page-title\">Valid signature.<br>Closed window. <span>STOP.</span></h1>\n      <p class=\"dek\">Ascertain time. Carry signed evidence with the task. Verify. This historical packet binds the same 228 bytes to a signed witness interval. The holder compares that interval with the task window and decides.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section id=\"packet\" class=\"instrument\" aria-labelledby=\"instrument-title\">\n      <div class=\"instrument-head\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Time-window instrument</p>\n          <h2 id=\"instrument-title\">One packet / two intervals</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"nucleus-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"timeline\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The execution window ends on August 30 at 20:05 UTC. The witness window begins on August 31 at 05:02:06 UTC. The intervals do not overlap.\">\n        <div class=\"date-rail\">\n          <p><strong>30 AUG 2026</strong><span>execution</span></p>\n          <p><strong>31 AUG 2026</strong><span>witness</span></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bands\">\n          <div class=\"band-row execution-row\">\n            <p class=\"band-label\">20:00Z</p>\n            <div class=\"execution-band\"><span>5 minutes</span></div>\n            <p class=\"band-label end\">20:05Z</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"night-gap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>schedule closes</span><i></i><span>checkpoint arrives</span></div>\n          <div class=\"band-row witness-row\">\n            <p class=\"band-label\">05:02:06Z</p>\n            <div class=\"witness-band\"><span>20 seconds</span></div>\n            <p class=\"band-label end\">05:02:26Z</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"fact-grid\" aria-label=\"Packet result\">\n        <div><span>Schedule bytes</span><strong data-field=\"byte-length\">228</strong></div>\n        <div><span>Signature</span><strong data-field=\"signature\">checking</strong></div>\n        <div><span>Window overlap</span><strong data-field=\"overlap\">false</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"stop-cell\"><span>Local policy</span><strong>STOP</strong></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"boundary\">The signature proves origin and integrity. It does not grant permission, schedule work, or perform the action.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"byte-test\" aria-labelledby=\"byte-title\">\n      <div class=\"section-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</div>\n      <div class=\"byte-copy\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Digest control</p>\n        <h2 id=\"byte-title\">One flipped byte.<br>Hash breaks.</h2>\n        <p>Change offset <code>226</code> in the exact schedule. The signed receipt stays untouched. Verification must fail closed.</p>\n        <div class=\"byte-readout\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n          <p><span>Offset</span><strong>226</strong></p>\n          <p><span>Original</span><strong data-field=\"original-byte\">0x7d&nbsp; }</strong></p>\n          <p><span>Changed</span><strong data-field=\"tampered-byte\">0x7c&nbsp; |</strong></p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"button-row\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-action=\"flip\" disabled>Flip byte 226</button>\n          <button class=\"quiet\" type=\"button\" data-action=\"reset\">Reset</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <output class=\"test-result\" data-field=\"tamper-result\">\n        <span>Expected error</span>\n        <strong>witness_payload_digest_<wbr>does_not_match_expected</strong>\n        <small>Run the control to compare the mutated bytes.</small>\n      </output>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"instructions\" aria-labelledby=\"instructions-title\">\n      <div class=\"instructions-head\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Two skins / one packet</p>\n        <h2 id=\"instructions-title\">Read it or run it.</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"instruction-columns\">\n        <article>\n          <h3>Humans</h3>\n          <ol>\n            <li>Open the JSON.</li>\n            <li>Compare <code>execution_window_utc</code> to <code>witness_window_utc</code>.</li>\n            <li>Change one character in the schedule bytes.</li>\n          </ol>\n        </article>\n        <article>\n          <h3>Agents</h3>\n          <ol>\n            <li>Load the packet. Verify signature and digest.</li>\n            <li>Apply the witness window to the execution window.</li>\n            <li>Emit stop or proceed from <code>evaluation-outcomes.json</code>.</li>\n            <li>Mutate byte 226 and verify again.</li>\n          </ol>\n          <p class=\"agent-warning\">Do not request a paid anchor.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <nav class=\"source-index\" aria-label=\"Public source files\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Source index</p>\n      <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/main/examples/witness/evaluation-packet.production.json\"><span>01</span>Raw STOP packet</a>\n      <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/main/examples/witness/evaluation-packet.proceed-002.production.json\"><span>02</span>Raw PROCEED packet</a>\n      <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/main/examples/witness/evaluation-outcomes.json\"><span>03</span>evaluation-outcomes.json</a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/tree/main/verify/typescript\"><span>04</span>verify/typescript</a>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/violetclaire/popcorn-temporal-anchor/tree/main/verify/python\"><span>05</span>verify/python</a>\n    </nav>\n\n    <footer>\n      <p>POPCORN witnesses the fingerprint within its stated time interval. The holder decides.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"/SKILL.md\">Agent instructions</a> · <a href=\"/agents\">Signed time and task checkpoints</a></p>\n      <p data-field=\"load-status\" role=\"status\">Loading the public packet...</p>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"/demo/demo.js\" defer></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
  },
